1
00:02:04,080 --> 00:02:05,040
Zheng Yu?

2
00:02:07,680 --> 00:02:08,880
Why are you here?

3
00:02:10,080 --> 00:02:12,760
I just finished some experiments.
I'm on my way home.

4
00:02:12,840 --> 00:02:14,000
Do you live here?

5
00:02:16,520 --> 00:02:18,280
- You're here for…?
- Tutoring.

6
00:02:19,200 --> 00:02:21,280
Do you know where Building 14 is?

7
00:02:21,960 --> 00:02:22,800
Building 14?

8
00:02:28,760 --> 00:02:31,080
It's hard to find. I'll take you there.

9
00:02:34,560 --> 00:02:37,560
By the way, I forgot
to give you this at the ward last time.

10
00:02:37,640 --> 00:02:38,800
Here you go.

11
00:02:46,000 --> 00:02:49,080
Was it because you saw this
that you were curious?

12
00:02:54,400 --> 00:02:56,440
How much farther? Let's hurry.

13
00:03:04,560 --> 00:03:06,000
BLOCK A, BUILDING 014

14
00:03:07,800 --> 00:03:08,840
This is it.

15
00:03:10,040 --> 00:03:10,960
Thank you.

16
00:03:24,320 --> 00:03:25,160
Yanzhou?

17
00:03:26,240 --> 00:03:27,840
Why are you two together?

18
00:03:32,760 --> 00:03:33,720
This is my cousin.

19
00:03:35,760 --> 00:03:37,560
Do you know my tutor?

20
00:03:38,800 --> 00:03:41,480
No, we just happened
to both be at the door.

21
00:03:42,040 --> 00:03:44,560
Here's your assignment.
Stop making excuses.

22
00:03:45,280 --> 00:03:46,160
I'm leaving.

23
00:03:46,240 --> 00:03:48,000
Since you're Gao Xing's tutor,

24
00:03:48,600 --> 00:03:49,520
stay for dinner.

25
00:03:49,600 --> 00:03:51,120
Yanzhou, no!

26
00:03:51,200 --> 00:03:53,040
- No, thanks.
- What's going on?

27
00:04:00,120 --> 00:04:02,440
Gao Xing's tutor delivered her assignment?

28
00:04:03,800 --> 00:04:04,640
Hello.

29
00:04:05,480 --> 00:04:06,720
Hello, ma'am.

30
00:04:17,120 --> 00:04:19,839
Don't be shy. Feel free to look around.

31
00:04:22,120 --> 00:04:23,240
Come in.

32
00:04:35,680 --> 00:04:39,960
ELEGANT CHAMBER OF FRAGRANT ORCHIDS
CHEN YANZHOU

33
00:04:41,160 --> 00:04:42,800
My aunt said you could look around,

34
00:04:42,880 --> 00:04:44,880
and you really made yourself at home.

35
00:04:46,760 --> 00:04:49,440
Ms. Zhou, do you need help?

36
00:04:55,320 --> 00:04:57,080
Here. Do you have enough?

37
00:04:57,160 --> 00:04:58,680
Yes, thank you.

38
00:04:58,760 --> 00:05:00,840
I made these scrambled eggs with tomatoes.

39
00:05:00,920 --> 00:05:04,120
Of course, this is also
the only dish I'm good at.

40
00:05:04,200 --> 00:05:05,440
Try it.

41
00:05:07,160 --> 00:05:08,440
Uncle,

42
00:05:08,520 --> 00:05:10,200
who cooks their signature dish

43
00:05:10,280 --> 00:05:11,960
and ends up making such a mess?

44
00:05:14,400 --> 00:05:15,840
You brat.

45
00:05:15,920 --> 00:05:16,800
You're so naughty.

46
00:05:17,640 --> 00:05:20,120
How could you embarrass me like that?

47
00:05:20,640 --> 00:05:23,040
I remember Yanzhou was
a picky eater as a child.

48
00:05:23,120 --> 00:05:25,680
He wouldn't even touch
scrambled eggs with tomatoes.

49
00:05:26,360 --> 00:05:27,920
Now that he has grown up,

50
00:05:28,000 --> 00:05:29,680
he's not as picky anymore.

51
00:05:30,360 --> 00:05:32,120
It doesn't sound like a compliment.

52
00:05:39,480 --> 00:05:40,760
I was wrong.

53
00:05:43,200 --> 00:05:44,600
Okay, all right.

54
00:05:51,240 --> 00:05:52,720
I thought we were strangers.

55
00:05:52,800 --> 00:05:55,520
If you hide here, won't you be exposed?

56
00:05:55,600 --> 00:05:57,040
I don't know what to say.

57
00:05:57,640 --> 00:05:58,920
Are my parents that scary?

58
00:05:59,640 --> 00:06:00,840
They're quite nice.

59
00:06:01,440 --> 00:06:03,880
If you ask me, your cousin is scarier.

60
00:06:05,880 --> 00:06:07,520
Is the fearless Ms. Zheng

61
00:06:07,600 --> 00:06:09,240
afraid of a senior high school student?

62
00:06:12,400 --> 00:06:13,720
Let me help you.

63
00:06:15,920 --> 00:06:16,880
What happened here?

64
00:06:19,200 --> 00:06:21,640
It's just a winter rash
from the damp weather.

65
00:06:21,720 --> 00:06:23,240
I'll apply ointment later.

66
00:06:27,800 --> 00:06:29,000
Yanzhou,

67
00:06:29,080 --> 00:06:30,400
I ordered dry cleaning.

68
00:06:30,480 --> 00:06:33,200
I'll add your jacket that's on the sofa.

69
00:06:33,280 --> 00:06:35,280
- Okay.
- Is there anything in the pockets?

70
00:06:35,360 --> 00:06:36,520
No…

71
00:06:40,600 --> 00:06:42,480
No, there is something here.

72
00:06:43,080 --> 00:06:44,200
What is it?

73
00:06:44,280 --> 00:06:46,440
Whose student ID card is this?

74
00:06:48,720 --> 00:06:50,360
Does it belong to your classmate?

75
00:06:54,880 --> 00:06:56,760
It's an upperclassman.

76
00:07:20,360 --> 00:07:22,240
<i>Is your mom okay?</i>

77
00:07:22,320 --> 00:07:23,480
<i>She…</i>

78
00:07:25,320 --> 00:07:28,360
<i>Don't assume that a few conversations</i>
<i>and a few meetings</i>

79
00:07:28,440 --> 00:07:30,160
<i>make us close friends.</i>

80
00:07:30,240 --> 00:07:33,240
<i>Don't you think</i>
<i>that is a personal question?</i>

81
00:07:51,280 --> 00:07:52,360
Wait!

82
00:07:54,000 --> 00:07:54,840
Wait.

83
00:07:54,920 --> 00:07:56,720
ROUTE 89

84
00:08:17,160 --> 00:08:20,360
STUDENT IDENTIFICATION CARD
NAME: ZHOU GUANQI

85
00:08:51,520 --> 00:08:54,440
<i>We were having a nice meal.</i>
<i>Why did you have to bring her up?</i>

86
00:08:54,520 --> 00:08:56,840
<i>Now I've lost my appetite.</i>

87
00:09:00,920 --> 00:09:02,880
Why did Chen Huimei tell you to come?

88
00:09:02,960 --> 00:09:05,080
There's no lesson today,
but with you here,

89
00:09:05,160 --> 00:09:07,480
this feels like a tutoring session.

90
00:09:07,560 --> 00:09:10,080
Bear with it. She told me
to come tomorrow too.

91
00:09:10,160 --> 00:09:12,880
Tomorrow is Lunar New Year's Eve.
Why would you come?

92
00:09:12,960 --> 00:09:14,960
No, I have to teach her a lesson.

93
00:09:15,040 --> 00:09:17,520
If you went to your uncle's house
for the holiday,

94
00:09:17,600 --> 00:09:18,880
your mom wouldn't worry.

95
00:09:19,520 --> 00:09:22,800
I don't want to spend the holiday
at his place or with you.

96
00:09:22,880 --> 00:09:24,280
At dinner last time,

97
00:09:24,360 --> 00:09:26,560
you and your uncle seemed close.

98
00:09:26,640 --> 00:09:28,800
Why won't you go to his house?

99
00:09:28,880 --> 00:09:32,520
I'm afraid of saying the wrong thing
around my aunt

100
00:09:32,600 --> 00:09:34,080
and ending up like last time.

101
00:09:36,080 --> 00:09:38,000
<i>Whose student ID card is this?</i>

102
00:09:38,880 --> 00:09:40,520
<i>Does it belong to your classmate?</i>

103
00:09:47,640 --> 00:09:50,080
Do you mean that day
that we had dinner together?

104
00:09:50,160 --> 00:09:52,360
Yes. That day…

105
00:09:58,640 --> 00:10:01,240
Whatever. It's fine to tell you.

106
00:10:02,000 --> 00:10:03,440
Actually,

107
00:10:03,520 --> 00:10:05,000
that student ID card

108
00:10:05,080 --> 00:10:07,440
doesn't belong to some upperclassman.

109
00:10:07,520 --> 00:10:09,120
It's my other cousin's.

110
00:10:09,880 --> 00:10:12,560
My aunt's other son.

111
00:10:12,640 --> 00:10:14,240
His name was Zhou Guanqi.

112
00:10:15,160 --> 00:10:16,320
Six years ago,

113
00:10:17,400 --> 00:10:18,480
he passed away.

114
00:10:19,520 --> 00:10:21,080
It was a huge shock to my aunt.

115
00:10:21,160 --> 00:10:22,520
She fell ill.

116
00:10:23,280 --> 00:10:24,360
When she woke up,

117
00:10:24,960 --> 00:10:26,720
she forgot Guanqi.

118
00:10:28,880 --> 00:10:30,000
Forgot?

119
00:10:30,560 --> 00:10:32,600
Do you mean amnesia?

120
00:10:34,440 --> 00:10:36,280
The adults said

121
00:10:36,360 --> 00:10:38,000
it was from too much grief.

122
00:10:38,080 --> 00:10:40,240
In order to protect her,

123
00:10:40,320 --> 00:10:42,160
her mind blocked part of her memories.

124
00:10:42,880 --> 00:10:44,640
I've heard of this before.

125
00:10:44,720 --> 00:10:46,440
But it's usually temporary.

126
00:10:46,520 --> 00:10:49,440
After a while, the patient will
recover their memories.

127
00:10:49,520 --> 00:10:51,280
I wouldn't know either way.

128
00:10:51,360 --> 00:10:55,720
Maybe my aunt is just more devastated
than other people.

129
00:11:02,960 --> 00:11:04,320
Feels good to get it out.

130
00:11:04,920 --> 00:11:07,320
So did none of you
ever tell her about this?

131
00:11:08,880 --> 00:11:11,080
My aunt is doing very well now.

132
00:11:11,160 --> 00:11:12,480
If it were you,

133
00:11:13,440 --> 00:11:14,400
would you tell her?

134
00:11:16,760 --> 00:11:20,400
If you ever see her in the neighborhood,
remember to keep the secret.

135
00:11:26,360 --> 00:11:27,320
Yanzhou.

136
00:11:28,920 --> 00:11:31,000
Your grandma is coming to dinner tomorrow.

137
00:11:31,080 --> 00:11:32,800
Does this outfit look all right?

138
00:11:34,640 --> 00:11:37,400
You should wear bright colors
more often. It looks good.

139
00:11:38,000 --> 00:11:39,760
Really?

140
00:11:39,840 --> 00:11:41,880
Take a picture for me.

141
00:11:44,080 --> 00:11:45,240
It's not turning on.

142
00:11:46,800 --> 00:11:48,240
Is the battery flat?

143
00:11:59,720 --> 00:12:01,480
It's still not responding.

144
00:12:01,560 --> 00:12:02,440
Is it broken?

145
00:12:04,080 --> 00:12:06,400
I'll take it to a repair shop.

146
00:12:06,480 --> 00:12:09,120
The stores are probably closed
for the holidays.

147
00:12:09,200 --> 00:12:11,240
- What's wrong?
- There has to be one open.

148
00:12:11,320 --> 00:12:13,720
You can wait a few days
for the shops to open.

149
00:12:14,480 --> 00:12:16,040
- It's fine.
- Mom.

150
00:12:19,600 --> 00:12:20,440
I'll go.

151
00:12:20,520 --> 00:12:21,600
It's cold out.

152
00:12:35,040 --> 00:12:35,920
Tutoring today?

153
00:12:37,120 --> 00:12:39,240
Gao Xing is home alone. Her mom worries.

154
00:12:40,360 --> 00:12:42,200
My aunt is busy this time every year.

155
00:12:42,280 --> 00:12:44,720
Gao Xing usually went to her dad's house.

156
00:12:45,320 --> 00:12:47,400
This year, it wasn't an option.

157
00:12:47,480 --> 00:12:48,720
By the way,

158
00:12:48,800 --> 00:12:52,200
is the phone repair shop
next to the convenience store open?

159
00:12:52,920 --> 00:12:55,720
They should have closed
for the holidays already.

160
00:12:56,440 --> 00:12:58,040
Do you need your phone repaired?

161
00:12:58,120 --> 00:12:59,520
It's my mom.

162
00:12:59,600 --> 00:13:01,880
Her phone isn't working, and she needs it.

163
00:13:01,960 --> 00:13:03,840
I checked nearby shops.

164
00:13:03,920 --> 00:13:04,920
They're all closed.

165
00:13:05,760 --> 00:13:06,600
It's okay.

166
00:13:06,680 --> 00:13:08,840
I'll keep searching farther.

167
00:13:11,360 --> 00:13:13,520
My ride is here. I have to go.

168
00:13:15,800 --> 00:13:16,840
Wait.

169
00:13:18,240 --> 00:13:20,280
I know a place that can fix it.

170
00:13:23,280 --> 00:13:28,840
APPLIANCE REPAIRS

171
00:13:28,920 --> 00:13:30,760
Wait here.

172
00:13:30,840 --> 00:13:32,360
I'll go inside to talk to him.

173
00:13:35,280 --> 00:13:36,480
It's five years old.

174
00:13:37,080 --> 00:13:39,520
It's never had a problem
or its battery replaced.

175
00:13:40,120 --> 00:13:43,360
I'll pay any price if it can be fixed
and all files preserved.

176
00:13:43,440 --> 00:13:44,840
I'll transfer it to you.

177
00:13:45,800 --> 00:13:46,800
Is there a passcode?

178
00:13:48,840 --> 00:13:52,160
Don't worry. That person
has professional ethics.

179
00:13:53,440 --> 00:13:55,040
That's not what I meant.

180
00:13:55,120 --> 00:13:56,920
The passcode is 990508.

181
00:13:58,000 --> 00:13:58,880
Okay.

182
00:14:01,600 --> 00:14:04,560
JIANG HAIXING DIGITAL REPAIR

183
00:14:04,640 --> 00:14:07,400
PROFESSIONAL CELL PHONE, COMPUTER,
AND DIGITAL DEVICE REPAIR CENTER

184
00:14:09,400 --> 00:14:10,920
What took so long?

185
00:14:16,200 --> 00:14:17,360
A rare guest.

186
00:14:20,240 --> 00:14:22,040
- Can you fix it?
- We're closed.

187
00:14:22,800 --> 00:14:23,640
Name your price.

188
00:14:31,320 --> 00:14:33,280
- Is it yours?
- A classmate's.

189
00:14:34,720 --> 00:14:36,520
What classmate? Are you close?

190
00:14:37,280 --> 00:14:38,520
Can it be fixed?

191
00:14:39,600 --> 00:14:41,160
Pay a 300-yuan deposit.

192
00:14:48,120 --> 00:14:50,600
<i>WeChat Pay, 100 yuan.</i>

193
00:14:50,680 --> 00:14:51,680
Deposit of 100 yuan.

194
00:14:52,240 --> 00:14:56,360
I will message you
about the phone's usage and passcode.

195
00:14:56,440 --> 00:15:00,400
Do not lose a single file in it.
What time will it be ready?

196
00:15:02,800 --> 00:15:04,560
You just fire out orders.

197
00:15:04,640 --> 00:15:05,840
Look at what time it is.

198
00:15:05,920 --> 00:15:08,040
And you had to pick this hour.

199
00:15:08,120 --> 00:15:10,840
Why don't you go somewhere else?
I'll keep the deposit.

200
00:15:12,120 --> 00:15:14,160
I wonder where you got the money.

201
00:15:18,960 --> 00:15:20,080
I found a repair shop.

202
00:15:21,880 --> 00:15:23,080
Zheng Yu knows them.

203
00:15:23,160 --> 00:15:26,080
Yes, Gao Xing's tutor.

204
00:15:27,640 --> 00:15:28,520
Okay.

205
00:15:29,280 --> 00:15:30,520
I'm hanging up.

206
00:15:42,400 --> 00:15:44,760
- How did it go?
- You can pick it up this time tomorrow.

207
00:15:44,840 --> 00:15:47,080
Sis? Why are you here?

208
00:15:48,560 --> 00:15:50,160
The laptop is fixed.

209
00:15:53,320 --> 00:15:55,120
He didn't mention the laptop to me.

210
00:15:55,200 --> 00:15:57,200
Didn't you tell him whose it was?

211
00:15:57,280 --> 00:15:58,400
I didn't.

212
00:15:58,480 --> 00:16:00,760
On that page it was stuck at,
there was a name.

213
00:16:00,840 --> 00:16:02,280
"Chen Yanzhou."

214
00:16:04,000 --> 00:16:06,160
I… I see.

215
00:16:11,480 --> 00:16:13,240
- I'm leaving.
- Let's get dinner.

216
00:16:15,440 --> 00:16:16,560
No, thanks.

217
00:16:16,640 --> 00:16:18,680
- I can join you two.
- Go home.

218
00:16:18,760 --> 00:16:20,080
What about tomorrow night?

219
00:16:30,880 --> 00:16:32,640
What did your brother mean?

220
00:16:32,720 --> 00:16:33,800
What name?

221
00:16:33,880 --> 00:16:36,160
When I was working
on the competition slides,

222
00:16:36,240 --> 00:16:37,320
I mistyped.

223
00:16:37,400 --> 00:16:38,960
My brother saw it.

224
00:16:40,880 --> 00:16:42,680
Is my name that easy to type?

225
00:16:45,320 --> 00:16:47,440
Do you want your phone back or not?

226
00:16:59,200 --> 00:17:04,440
FORTUNE

227
00:17:09,440 --> 00:17:10,680
Ms. Zhou, what's up?

228
00:17:12,680 --> 00:17:13,560
Nothing.

229
00:17:13,640 --> 00:17:16,040
I'm just seeing
if the decoration is crooked.

230
00:17:18,520 --> 00:17:20,280
It's perspective. Don't believe me?

231
00:17:21,000 --> 00:17:22,280
Look at it from here.

232
00:17:22,800 --> 00:17:23,760
You're right.

233
00:17:23,839 --> 00:17:25,000
Mom is here.

234
00:17:25,720 --> 00:17:27,280
- Mom, be careful.
- Grandma.

235
00:17:28,440 --> 00:17:29,720
Hello.

236
00:17:31,280 --> 00:17:32,560
Dinner will be ready soon.

237
00:17:33,080 --> 00:17:35,520
Just two more dishes. Sit first.

238
00:17:36,480 --> 00:17:39,040
You don't have to make so much.
We can't eat it all.

239
00:17:39,880 --> 00:17:42,280
I was thinking of ten dishes.

240
00:17:42,800 --> 00:17:44,360
A perfectly round number.

241
00:17:44,440 --> 00:17:45,560
For good luck.

242
00:17:45,640 --> 00:17:47,520
How can anything be perfect?

243
00:17:47,600 --> 00:17:48,600
- Xiao--
- Mom.

244
00:17:49,680 --> 00:17:52,200
Don't be angry. Come, sit.

245
00:17:52,800 --> 00:17:54,200
Calm down.

246
00:17:55,400 --> 00:17:56,240
Calm down.

247
00:18:00,280 --> 00:18:03,480
Mom is angry that there won't be
chicken stewed with chestnuts.

248
00:18:03,560 --> 00:18:05,800
It won't be perfect
without her favorite dish.

249
00:18:10,800 --> 00:18:13,040
I'll help you with the rest of the dishes.

250
00:18:16,920 --> 00:18:18,760
Yanzhou, keep your grandma company.

251
00:18:18,840 --> 00:18:19,680
Okay.

252
00:18:32,520 --> 00:18:34,040
How is your health?

253
00:18:35,160 --> 00:18:36,360
Pretty good.

254
00:18:37,280 --> 00:18:38,680
Your mom is really something.

255
00:18:38,760 --> 00:18:41,640
She birthed two kids
but couldn't take good care of either.

256
00:18:42,320 --> 00:18:43,640
So…

257
00:18:43,720 --> 00:18:45,680
It's okay.

258
00:18:45,760 --> 00:18:46,840
Break in the new year!

259
00:18:46,920 --> 00:18:48,280
- It's okay.
- Look at me.

260
00:18:48,360 --> 00:18:50,000
- It's okay.
- I'm so clumsy.

261
00:18:50,080 --> 00:18:51,280
It's all right.

262
00:18:51,360 --> 00:18:52,720
It slipped and…

263
00:18:52,800 --> 00:18:55,440
Yes, that's what happens.

264
00:18:57,360 --> 00:18:59,160
How heartless.

265
00:19:02,400 --> 00:19:03,440
Can't she even laugh?

266
00:19:08,200 --> 00:19:09,040
She can.

267
00:19:09,120 --> 00:19:10,560
Why not?

268
00:19:11,560 --> 00:19:14,960
Your mom forgot that she is
a very negligent mother.

269
00:19:15,040 --> 00:19:17,920
She forgot completely.
Of course she can laugh out loud.

270
00:19:20,080 --> 00:19:23,080
The only one who is agonized
is this old lady here.

271
00:19:23,160 --> 00:19:25,880
In order to accommodate your mother,
for six years,

272
00:19:25,960 --> 00:19:28,760
I didn't even dare
to speak my own grandson's name.

273
00:19:32,840 --> 00:19:34,560
Can't you bear with it?

274
00:19:35,360 --> 00:19:38,200
It's only one day a year
when you need to cooperate.

275
00:19:42,080 --> 00:19:43,240
You make it sound

276
00:19:44,080 --> 00:19:45,240
like I'm in the wrong.

277
00:19:51,760 --> 00:19:53,000
Xiaozheng,

278
00:19:53,080 --> 00:19:57,040
tonight, do you want to eat
freshly-wrapped dumplings

279
00:19:57,120 --> 00:19:58,440
or go out to eat?

280
00:19:58,520 --> 00:19:59,640
I've got an errand.

281
00:20:01,200 --> 00:20:02,760
On Lunar New Year's Eve?

282
00:20:03,680 --> 00:20:05,080
It's for a classmate.

283
00:20:06,080 --> 00:20:08,200
Which classmate is so inconsiderate?

284
00:20:08,280 --> 00:20:10,560
How could they send you
on an errand today?

285
00:20:11,200 --> 00:20:12,440
Let me tell you,

286
00:20:12,520 --> 00:20:14,680
working overtime during holidays

287
00:20:15,320 --> 00:20:17,000
is triple the pay.

288
00:20:17,600 --> 00:20:20,160
Remember to up your price.

289
00:20:22,120 --> 00:20:23,080
Got it.

290
00:20:25,040 --> 00:20:25,880
Wait.

291
00:20:27,120 --> 00:20:28,920
Wear a scarf.

292
00:20:29,000 --> 00:20:29,840
Keep warm.

293
00:20:31,080 --> 00:20:32,280
Make money today

294
00:20:32,360 --> 00:20:34,120
to make a fortune next year.

295
00:20:37,240 --> 00:20:38,400
Thank you.

296
00:20:41,440 --> 00:20:43,280
Didn't you invite Gao Xing?

297
00:20:43,360 --> 00:20:46,000
I did. She said she ordered McDonald's.

298
00:20:48,400 --> 00:20:49,240
And your grandma?

299
00:20:50,400 --> 00:20:52,960
Why did she leave without eating dinner?

300
00:20:54,920 --> 00:20:57,920
Maybe because there isn't
chicken stewed with chestnuts.

301
00:20:58,680 --> 00:20:59,960
Nonsense.

302
00:21:03,040 --> 00:21:04,440
That's just how my mom is.

303
00:21:05,120 --> 00:21:07,040
Maybe she went to play mahjong.

304
00:21:08,360 --> 00:21:11,080
Did you say something rude to her?

305
00:21:11,160 --> 00:21:13,320
If you did, call her and apologize.

306
00:21:17,600 --> 00:21:20,440
I'm full. I'm going out
to pick up the phone.

307
00:21:34,760 --> 00:21:38,200
PROFESSIONAL CELL PHONE, COMPUTER,
AND DIGITAL DEVICE REPAIR CENTER

308
00:21:48,760 --> 00:21:49,800
Here.

309
00:21:53,960 --> 00:21:55,400
Zheng Yu, why are you here?

310
00:21:56,000 --> 00:21:57,280
Sit and eat with us.

311
00:21:57,360 --> 00:21:58,400
No way.

312
00:21:59,040 --> 00:22:01,400
You drop by on Lunar New Year's Eve.

313
00:22:01,480 --> 00:22:04,560
You even came empty-handed. How rude.

314
00:22:05,720 --> 00:22:08,720
What's this? Only came to freeload?

315
00:22:08,800 --> 00:22:11,040
Do I owe your family or something?

316
00:22:11,120 --> 00:22:12,320
I'm your uncle,

317
00:22:12,400 --> 00:22:14,160
not your father.

318
00:22:16,000 --> 00:22:18,320
I came for the phone.
I'll go after I get it.

319
00:22:24,760 --> 00:22:25,640
Also…

320
00:22:28,480 --> 00:22:31,600
what's the point of having your mom
lying in rehab like that?

321
00:22:32,200 --> 00:22:33,400
It has been three years.

322
00:22:33,480 --> 00:22:35,680
She's hanging on by a thread.

323
00:22:35,760 --> 00:22:37,400
Yet, you spend beyond your means,

324
00:22:37,480 --> 00:22:39,120
hiring two caregivers for her.

325
00:22:39,880 --> 00:22:41,520
If you're so filial,

326
00:22:41,600 --> 00:22:43,200
take her home.

327
00:22:43,280 --> 00:22:45,520
You're her daughter.
Care for her yourself.

328
00:22:47,120 --> 00:22:48,200
Have you found it?

329
00:22:56,320 --> 00:22:58,320
If she doesn't make it,

330
00:22:58,400 --> 00:22:59,480
that's her fate.

331
00:23:00,640 --> 00:23:01,480
Set her free.

332
00:23:03,240 --> 00:23:04,440
You ungrateful girl!

333
00:23:05,720 --> 00:23:08,320
Is she an ungrateful girl or what?!

334
00:23:09,040 --> 00:23:11,760
When you were chased
and beaten for gambling debts,

335
00:23:11,840 --> 00:23:15,480
if my mom hadn't paid it off for you,
you would have been crippled.

336
00:23:17,240 --> 00:23:18,760
I know you won't repay it.

337
00:23:19,360 --> 00:23:20,800
I'm also not asking you to.

338
00:23:21,440 --> 00:23:22,800
But I ask you

339
00:23:23,520 --> 00:23:24,880
to show respect to my mom.

340
00:23:32,760 --> 00:23:33,680
Also,

341
00:23:35,480 --> 00:23:38,440
you tell me to take my mom home
and care for her.

342
00:23:40,160 --> 00:23:41,520
But, Uncle…

343
00:23:45,440 --> 00:23:46,920
do I have a home?

344
00:24:26,760 --> 00:24:28,160
Zheng Yu.

345
00:24:28,800 --> 00:24:30,680
- Don't follow me.
- Zheng Yu.

346
00:24:31,400 --> 00:24:32,680
It's Lunar New Year's Eve.

347
00:24:32,760 --> 00:24:35,000
If you don't want to stay,
I'll go with you.

348
00:24:38,000 --> 00:24:39,320
Every day, I care for Mom,

349
00:24:39,400 --> 00:24:41,920
go to class, make money,
and pay off debts.

350
00:24:42,000 --> 00:24:43,840
I'm exhausted enough already.

351
00:24:43,920 --> 00:24:46,480
I don't have the energy
to waste time with you.

352
00:24:48,160 --> 00:24:49,840
When our family was in trouble,

353
00:24:49,920 --> 00:24:52,320
Jiang Haixing still bought stuff
for you monthly.

354
00:24:52,920 --> 00:24:54,800
When I asked to borrow money from him,

355
00:24:55,400 --> 00:24:57,200
he referred me to Wu Fa.

356
00:24:59,600 --> 00:25:01,640
Dad's side of the family

357
00:25:01,720 --> 00:25:03,600
would only take you out to eat.

358
00:25:04,680 --> 00:25:06,440
When we stayed at their place,

359
00:25:07,200 --> 00:25:08,960
they bought you a new bed.

360
00:25:09,040 --> 00:25:10,120
I slept on the floor.

361
00:25:11,680 --> 00:25:14,640
Having all this, you should behave.

362
00:25:16,840 --> 00:25:18,840
So what if it's Lunar New Year's Eve?

363
00:25:20,640 --> 00:25:23,360
It only makes me seem more pathetic.

364
00:26:12,240 --> 00:26:14,240
RED PACKET

365
00:26:23,320 --> 00:26:26,280
FROM XIAOMIAN

366
00:26:26,360 --> 00:26:28,400
<i>Sis, happy Lunar New Year.</i>

367
00:28:20,040 --> 00:28:22,400
I've heard that eating ice cream
when you're unhappy

368
00:28:23,000 --> 00:28:24,480
can freeze your tears.

369
00:28:38,440 --> 00:28:39,520
You believe that?

370
00:28:40,760 --> 00:28:42,120
I was a kid.

371
00:28:42,200 --> 00:28:43,880
I believed anything people said.

372
00:28:59,800 --> 00:29:02,640
You and your uncle are clearly
on bad terms.

373
00:29:02,720 --> 00:29:05,160
Why did you still help me fix the phone?

374
00:29:07,160 --> 00:29:08,600
You heard everything?

375
00:29:10,760 --> 00:29:13,600
When I arrived at the shop,
I thought you hadn't come yet.

376
00:29:14,520 --> 00:29:17,760
The door was open, so I thought
I would pick up the phone first.

377
00:29:18,480 --> 00:29:19,720
In the end,

378
00:29:19,800 --> 00:29:21,840
I heard you and your uncle fighting.

379
00:29:24,320 --> 00:29:25,200
Why help me?

380
00:29:27,040 --> 00:29:28,120
I wasn't helping you.

381
00:29:28,680 --> 00:29:29,880
I was helping your mom.

382
00:29:33,000 --> 00:29:34,280
Gao Xing

383
00:29:34,360 --> 00:29:35,960
told me about your mom.

384
00:29:40,960 --> 00:29:42,240
I didn't mean to pry.

385
00:29:43,720 --> 00:29:44,800
I didn't say anything.

386
00:29:48,600 --> 00:29:51,440
I was afraid you would say
it's too personal again.

387
00:29:55,680 --> 00:29:56,680
You hold a grudge.

388
00:30:03,120 --> 00:30:05,800
I apologize for what I said before.

389
00:30:06,400 --> 00:30:07,720
It's not that serious.

390
00:30:11,600 --> 00:30:14,080
Then we're even now.

391
00:30:16,200 --> 00:30:17,640
What do you mean?

392
00:30:18,160 --> 00:30:20,480
You inquired about Zhou Guanqi.

393
00:30:20,560 --> 00:30:22,600
I went to the hospital ward uninvited.

394
00:30:23,560 --> 00:30:26,520
You unintentionally learned about my mom.

395
00:30:26,600 --> 00:30:29,960
I accidentally overheard you
and your uncle.

396
00:30:30,520 --> 00:30:31,920
We're even.

397
00:30:36,440 --> 00:30:37,960
Is that how it's counted?

398
00:30:43,560 --> 00:30:44,680
It's snowing.

399
00:31:02,000 --> 00:31:03,120
Zheng Yu.

400
00:31:05,960 --> 00:31:07,280
Happy Lunar New Year.

401
00:31:10,080 --> 00:31:12,640
Happy Lunar New Year, Chen Yanzhou.

402
00:32:35,640 --> 00:32:38,560
<i>Our city center square has</i>
<i>a Lunar New Year's Eve event.</i>

403
00:32:38,640 --> 00:32:41,000
<i>I'm being squished to death!</i>

404
00:32:41,080 --> 00:32:42,680
<i>I'm so exhausted.</i>

405
00:32:42,760 --> 00:32:44,480
<i>Everyone is taking it easy.</i>

406
00:32:44,560 --> 00:32:47,240
<i>I told my dad not to make a big feast.</i>

407
00:32:47,320 --> 00:32:49,040
<i>It's best if he makes me a salad.</i>

408
00:32:49,120 --> 00:32:51,960
<i>He really did put together</i>
<i>a few vegetable leaves.</i>

409
00:32:52,040 --> 00:32:54,720
<i>But there's no salad dressing,</i>
<i>so he added chili sauce!</i>

410
00:32:56,720 --> 00:32:58,360
<i>Hilarious!</i>

411
00:32:58,440 --> 00:33:01,360
<i>If I said I was dieting</i>
<i>during the holidays,</i>

412
00:33:01,440 --> 00:33:04,320
<i>my parents would</i>
<i>definitely bite my head off.</i>

413
00:33:04,400 --> 00:33:05,960
<i>Mine too!</i>

414
00:33:06,680 --> 00:33:09,040
<i>Zheng Yu, are you home yet?</i>

415
00:33:38,280 --> 00:33:41,640
It's the sixth day of the Lunar New Year.
Can't you give me a break?

416
00:33:46,120 --> 00:33:48,440
MITOCHONDRIA
MAIN SITE OF AEROBIC RESPIRATION

417
00:34:24,320 --> 00:34:27,000
Can we move
the Lantern Festival session to tomorrow?

418
00:34:27,080 --> 00:34:28,360
No.

419
00:34:28,440 --> 00:34:30,760
You know I'm busy tomorrow and can't come.

420
00:34:32,520 --> 00:34:33,560
Your competition.

421
00:34:34,440 --> 00:34:35,760
That's too bad.

422
00:34:35,840 --> 00:34:38,199
Just give me the Lantern Festival off.

423
00:34:38,280 --> 00:34:41,560
No. I've already confirmed the schedule
with your mom.

424
00:34:42,719 --> 00:34:46,679
Then let's take a photo of our lesson
at home and send it to her.

425
00:34:46,760 --> 00:34:48,080
Then you can take me out.

426
00:34:48,159 --> 00:34:50,719
She will still pay you. You get money.

427
00:34:50,800 --> 00:34:52,440
I get to have fun.

428
00:34:52,520 --> 00:34:53,600
Everyone's happy.

429
00:34:53,679 --> 00:34:57,120
I don't know what's fun.
You're asking the wrong person.

430
00:34:58,160 --> 00:35:00,960
Then I'll get Yanzhou to deal with you.

431
00:35:03,760 --> 00:35:05,280
Classmates, right?

432
00:35:06,080 --> 00:35:09,520
We just have a few classes together.
We're not close.

433
00:35:10,600 --> 00:35:11,640
I was right.

434
00:35:19,880 --> 00:35:21,040
Zhuang Ning?

435
00:35:21,120 --> 00:35:22,600
Why are you back so early?

436
00:35:23,520 --> 00:35:25,480
I wanted to watch you compete.

437
00:35:26,080 --> 00:35:28,520
Us? Is that worth
giving up your holiday for?

438
00:35:31,800 --> 00:35:33,080
Welcome.

439
00:35:37,720 --> 00:35:39,880
My mom packed my suitcase full of food.

440
00:35:39,960 --> 00:35:41,240
I barely have any clothes.

441
00:35:41,320 --> 00:35:44,160
I'm the opposite.
I have two suitcases this time.

442
00:35:45,560 --> 00:35:47,000
I don't believe

443
00:35:47,080 --> 00:35:48,680
you wheeled them here yourself.

444
00:35:49,680 --> 00:35:52,680
Happy Lunar New Year, Xiaolizi.

445
00:35:52,760 --> 00:35:54,920
Here. This is for you.

446
00:35:57,440 --> 00:35:58,720
Zhuang Ning,

447
00:35:58,800 --> 00:35:59,920
this is for you.

448
00:36:00,000 --> 00:36:02,720
This is my hometown's specialty.
It's delicious.

449
00:36:03,360 --> 00:36:04,240
Thank you.

450
00:36:04,320 --> 00:36:06,920
If hers is too spicy,
use this to cancel it out.

451
00:36:08,800 --> 00:36:10,360
I didn't bring any specialties.

452
00:36:10,440 --> 00:36:11,720
That's okay.

453
00:36:12,400 --> 00:36:13,520
I brought teabags.

454
00:36:19,200 --> 00:36:20,720
Then I'll help myself.

455
00:36:24,680 --> 00:36:25,760
Thank you.

456
00:36:27,360 --> 00:36:28,400
Right.

457
00:36:34,320 --> 00:36:35,400
Are you sure?

458
00:36:35,480 --> 00:36:37,040
What if she gives it back?

459
00:36:37,760 --> 00:36:39,360
Why did you bring four portions?

460
00:36:41,240 --> 00:36:42,760
When I first came to school,

461
00:36:42,840 --> 00:36:44,600
I also brought a lot of snacks.

462
00:36:44,680 --> 00:36:46,800
But Zheng Yu didn't take anything.

463
00:36:46,880 --> 00:36:49,720
I later discovered that
she stays here for the holidays.

464
00:36:49,800 --> 00:36:51,640
She never goes home.

465
00:36:51,720 --> 00:36:55,160
Since then, I haven't
brought back any specialties.

466
00:36:55,880 --> 00:36:57,080
I felt like I shouldn't.

467
00:36:59,600 --> 00:37:02,120
During the break,
I even asked in the group chat

468
00:37:02,200 --> 00:37:03,120
if she went home.

469
00:37:03,800 --> 00:37:05,920
That's enough. Let's not worry about it.

470
00:37:06,000 --> 00:37:07,680
Let's prepare for the competition.

471
00:37:23,920 --> 00:37:25,240
One, two, three.

472
00:37:25,320 --> 00:37:26,160
- Go!
- Go!

473
00:37:26,240 --> 00:37:28,760
EXCELLENCE CUP COLLEGE STUDENT
LIFE SCIENCES COMPETITION

474
00:37:46,080 --> 00:37:47,240
Zheng Yu.

475
00:37:47,960 --> 00:37:51,000
Zheng Yu, hurry inside.
They're drawing lots soon.

476
00:37:52,880 --> 00:37:54,240
What is that?

477
00:37:57,400 --> 00:37:59,080
Where is Chen Yanzhou?

478
00:37:59,160 --> 00:38:00,680
He didn't say he was coming.

479
00:38:01,880 --> 00:38:03,760
Then who were you waiting for?

480
00:38:03,840 --> 00:38:05,600
I wasn't. Just getting some air.

481
00:38:06,640 --> 00:38:07,480
Over there.

482
00:38:07,560 --> 00:38:09,440
Who was so awful?

483
00:38:09,520 --> 00:38:11,400
How could they knock over
our biggest patron--

484
00:38:12,000 --> 00:38:14,000
I mean, our biggest patroness?

485
00:38:17,920 --> 00:38:22,360
YE SHENG, CHAIRMAN AND CEO
OF NINGSHENG BIOTECH

486
00:38:22,440 --> 00:38:24,760
No, you're being modest. Too modest.

487
00:38:24,840 --> 00:38:28,200
As expected
of the industry's female elite.

488
00:38:30,880 --> 00:38:32,920
If Ms. Ye's schedule wasn't packed,

489
00:38:33,000 --> 00:38:34,800
this insignificant director

490
00:38:34,880 --> 00:38:36,920
wouldn't have the chance to be a judge

491
00:38:37,000 --> 00:38:38,600
with industry leaders like you.

492
00:38:38,680 --> 00:38:40,680
She truly is a wonder woman.

493
00:38:40,760 --> 00:38:43,800
No wonder she's still single.

494
00:38:44,320 --> 00:38:46,000
You can't say that carelessly.

495
00:38:46,080 --> 00:38:47,840
If the wrong person heard that,

496
00:38:48,440 --> 00:38:50,440
they would say we're being discriminatory.

497
00:38:50,520 --> 00:38:51,760
Yes, you're right.

498
00:38:52,280 --> 00:38:53,160
Wait.

499
00:39:00,600 --> 00:39:02,160
- Carry on.
- Sure.

500
00:39:05,480 --> 00:39:06,680
See for yourself.

501
00:39:06,760 --> 00:39:08,320
I've been looking.

502
00:39:08,400 --> 00:39:11,640
I don't see a place card
with the words "Cai Ronggen."

503
00:39:11,720 --> 00:39:13,520
I'm sorry.

504
00:39:13,600 --> 00:39:16,640
We only found out today that
Ms. Ye wouldn't be coming.

505
00:39:16,720 --> 00:39:18,960
We didn't have time to prepare one.
Please sit in her seat.

506
00:39:19,040 --> 00:39:21,720
We will have it replaced
before the competition starts.

507
00:39:22,760 --> 00:39:23,640
Wait.

508
00:39:24,440 --> 00:39:26,640
Was I done yet? Did I say you could leave?

509
00:39:28,920 --> 00:39:30,800
Is this how the organizer should act?

510
00:39:31,560 --> 00:39:33,920
Yes, I'm here on behalf of Ms. Ye,

511
00:39:34,000 --> 00:39:35,840
but should you be so negligent?

512
00:39:36,600 --> 00:39:39,640
It's a small place card,
and you drag your feet.

513
00:39:39,720 --> 00:39:41,280
Sorry, I'll get right on it.

514
00:39:41,360 --> 00:39:42,400
Hurry up!

515
00:39:43,560 --> 00:39:45,200
It's not like it's a credit card.

516
00:39:45,800 --> 00:39:48,960
Young people nowadays
just do a sloppy job.

517
00:39:49,040 --> 00:39:50,440
They need disciplining.

518
00:39:51,480 --> 00:39:52,560
Zheng Yu, over here.

519
00:39:52,640 --> 00:39:53,720
Sit here.

520
00:39:58,000 --> 00:40:00,000
Zhuang Ning said she wanted to watch us.

521
00:40:07,840 --> 00:40:10,400
Is NingSheng BioTech a sponsor this year?

522
00:40:11,680 --> 00:40:12,960
The biggest sponsor.

523
00:40:13,040 --> 00:40:16,840
They might hold the fate
of all the contestants in their hands.

524
00:40:34,320 --> 00:40:35,920
ZHENG YU
PRESENTATION ORDER NUMBER

525
00:40:38,920 --> 00:40:40,240
MR. LI

526
00:40:42,720 --> 00:40:43,880
<i>Where are you?</i>

527
00:40:44,480 --> 00:40:46,560
- I'm in a traffic jam.
<i>- It's rush hour.</i>

528
00:40:46,640 --> 00:40:48,640
<i>It's expected. You should've left early.</i>

529
00:40:51,080 --> 00:40:53,120
The campus is so close to home.

530
00:40:53,200 --> 00:40:55,800
<i>As the saying goes,</i>
<i>confidence breeds carelessness.</i>

531
00:40:55,880 --> 00:40:56,960
<i>Let me tell you,</i>

532
00:40:57,040 --> 00:40:58,880
<i>Zheng Yu was waiting for you.</i>

533
00:40:58,960 --> 00:41:00,840
<i>At least send her encouragement.</i>

534
00:41:00,920 --> 00:41:01,760
I know.

535
